{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和心理转折，逐屏连起来能看懂完整故事；Y只放大短语，单看大字容易缺少因果和上下文。small：Y的小字补充的心理层次更丰富，例如S03“越亲切，越能感到它离眼前有多远”、S09对过去自己的重新认识，都给出了额外信息。core：两版都清楚呈现了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的反复拉扯，最终也都落在不靠忍让换取陪伴、带着想念继续生活上，判平。concise：X的补充整体更收敛，Y有些地方把话里已经表达的犹疑、不安又解释了一遍。human：Y的“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”“最舍不得的，还是从前有人把他当作自己人的日子”搭配不够自然，S11“只凭这点指望回去忍让”也有压缩过度、关系不够顺的问题；X相应表达更符合日常说话习惯。fine：X的感受更集中于观众自身的身体反应和心理体验，例如S07后颈发凉、脉搏乱跳，S08胸口短暂吸进一口气；Y有些感受写成了音乐本身的变化和分析。load：Y的大字短语明显更短，尤其S10、S12等短停留屏，X的整块大字需要读的内容更多，Y更容易快速扫完。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52519214-0385-4119-bc10-cc32387f8b8e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T045737288190Z", "elapsed_seconds": 220.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:01:17.580131+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c9babe23a157ce852d1b2d804dbaaf4c60af3a0296ef882fc35627979414c1a4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0,